curtsy (0.2.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix tuning daemon eBPF observer never loading: correct an off-by-one
    jump offset that made the verifier reject the kprobe programs, and
    attach the kprobe PMU events per online CPU (perf_event_open rejects
    pid == -1 with cpu == -1).

